  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Thailand Bioenergy Sugar Ethanol Wastewater Management Project</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">To reduce greenhouse gas emissions through: (i) the avoidance of methane emissions from the wastewater treatment system of the ethanol plant; and (ii) the displacement of electricity produced from fossil fuel to electricity from methane collected from the new wastewater system.</narrative>
  </description>
